00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:51.680
So this is the starting point, or the impetus for&nbsp;
the game itself, the Tarnished being called by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:57.600
lost grace and returning to The Lands Between"
The Tarnished are a lot like the Unkindled of&nbsp;&nbsp;

